;; What the model reads of what brainyard/claude_host.clj's tools say back to it:
;; errors that say what to do next, notes, refusals (brainyard.tool-words/says,
;; byj-2e8.9). Read by the model, so a resource (RFC-001).
{"claude-host/type-line"
  "type-line types one line; put anything longer in a file and send a line that points at it"
 "claude-host/send-message"
  "session {id} began a turn as the message came, and took it into that turn, where nothing answers it"}
